@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title WF-3: SOC Alert Handling (v3.3 - via Detection Engine API)

participant "SOC Analyst\n(Browser)" as S #CCE5FF
participant "Core App\n(port 8000)" as CA #DAE8FC
participant "Detection Engine\n(port 8001)" as DE #FFF2CC
database "core-db" as CDB #F5F5F5
database "detection-db" as DDB #F5F5F5

== Authentication ==

S -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/login**\n(username, password)
activate CA
CA --> S : **200 OK** {access_token, role=SOC_ANALYST}
deactivate CA

== List Alerts ==
S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts**\n?status=open&risk_level=high\n+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DE : validate opaque bearer token → Session → User → Roles
DE -> DDB : SELECT alerts\nWHERE status=? AND risk_level=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : [alert1, alert2, ...]
deactivate DDB
DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alerts: [{id, login_attempt_id,\nrisk_level, status, created_at}]}
deactivate DE

== Alert Detail ==

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DDB : SELECT alerts WHERE id=?
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : alert record
deactivate DDB

DE -> DDB : SELECT login_attempts WHERE id=alert.login_attempt_id
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : login attempt context
deactivate DDB

DE -> DDB : SELECT risk_assessments WHERE login_attempt_id=?
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : risk scoring details
deactivate DDB
DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert, login_attempt, risk_assessment}
deactivate DE

== Alert Actions (v3.3 - CURRENT IMPLEMENTATION) ==

alt Acknowledge Alert
    S -> DE : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/acknowledge**
    + Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE

    DE -> DE : validate opaque bearer token → Session → User → Roles
    DE -> CDB : **GET /api/v1/internal/users/{user_id}**
    activate CDB
    CDB --> DE : user record (role=SOC_ANALYST)
    deactivate CDB

    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(status=acknowledged, assigned_to_id,\nupdated_at=NOW())
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB

    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=acknowledged,\nactor_id, old_value=open,\nnew_value=acknowledged, comment)

    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {status: "acknowledged"}}
    deactivate DE

else Resolve Alert
    S -> DE : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/resolve**
    {resolution: "true_attack"|"false_positive"|\n"benign_true_positive"|"insufficient_evidence", notes: "..."}
    + Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE

    DE -> CDB : **GET /api/v1/internal/users/{user_id}**
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(status=resolved, resolved_by_id,\nresolved_at=NOW(), resolution, notes)
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB

    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=resolved, actor_id,\nresolved_by_id, old_value=acknowledged,\nnew_value=resolved, comment)

    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {status: "resolved"}}
    deactivate DE

else Assign Alert
    S -> DE : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/assign**
    {assigned_to_id: "uuid"}
    + Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE

    DE -> CDB : **GET /api/v1/internal/users/{user_id}**
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(assigned_to_id=assigned_uuid)
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB

    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=assigned)

    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {assigned_to_id: "uuid"}}
    deactivate DE

else Protective Action
    S -> DE : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/actions**
    {action: "REQUIRE_MFA"|"REVOKE_SESSIONS"|\n"LOCK_USER"|"FORCE_LOGOUT", reason: "..."}
    + Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE

    DE -> DE : validate opaque bearer token → Session → User → Roles
    DE -> CDB : **POST /api/v1/internal/actions**
    (action, user_id, reason)
    activate CDB
    CDB --> DE : action result
    deactivate CDB

    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=action_executed)

    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{status: applied, details}
    deactivate DE
end

== Add Timeline Note (CURRENT IMPLEMENTATION) ==

S -> DE : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/timeline**
{event_type: "note_added", comment: "..."}
+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=note_added, comment)
DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{timeline_event}

deactivate DE

note over S, DDB
  **Alert State Machine (v3.3):**
  open → acknowledged → resolved
                   ↘ false_positive

  **Alert Timeline Event Types (current):**
  created, assigned, unassigned, acknowledged,
  note_added, status_changed, resolved, false_positive
  (timeline.event_type=escalated is a marker only;
   no /escalate endpoint is implemented in v3.3)

  **APPROVED DESIGN / IMPLEMENTATION PENDING:**
  - GET /api/v1/soc/dashboard
  - POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/escalate
  - POST /api/v1/policies (policy create endpoint)
end note

@enduml
